  "title": "Creamy Miso-Mushroom Stew",
  "description": "This mushroom stew with miso paste is fast to make with a handful of ingredients and two different types of mushrooms, portobello and shimeji mushrooms.",
  "authors": [
    "thedailygourmet"
  ],
